tasks.tsv: what Python's own XML parser (xml.etree, Python 3.14) reads from
the task XML files in tests/fixtures/atomic/ and tests/fixtures/written/,
one line per value (file, name, value), written by gen.py (see its header).
Independent of this crate: no code shared, only the Task Scheduler schema's
names.

plaso.tsv: what plaso (the log2timeline/plaso:20260720 Docker image) reads
from tests/fixtures/plaso/wintask.job with its winjob parser (psort -o
json_line): its two events (timestamp_desc and the time in microseconds,
the wall clock as plaso shows it) and the values both carry. Written from
plaso's output, not from this crate.
